      "side": 1,
      "message": "The unmount one.\nShould we change the mountUserId here:\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/refs/heads/master:frameworks/base/services/core/java/com/android/server/StorageManagerService.java;l\u003d2347;drc\u003d1cffd04f27538d58fb55ca30cbaf612f13a3a29e?\nSomething like:\nprivate void mount(VolumeInfo vol) {\n    updateVolumeMountIdIfRequired(vol);\n    try {\n        // TODO(b/135341433): Remove cautious logging when FUSE is stable\n        .\n        .\n        .\n    }\n}\nOR\nWrap around with updateVolumeMountIdIfRequired at Line#1356?\nSomething like:\nmHandler.obtainMessage(H_VOLUME_MOUNT, updateVolumeMountIdIfRequired(vol)).sendToTarget();",
