      "writtenOn": "2023-06-13T12:20:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I re-tested the above variations, but it still doesn\u0027t solve the problem. Unfortunately. we\u0027ll have to do that in the current form\nHere the logs for the above variations:\nStorageManagerService: Volume public:253,81 broadcasting ejecting to UserHandle{11}\nStorageManagerService: Volume public:253,81 broadcasting unmounted to UserHandle{0} \u003c- This should have been should have been UserHandle{11}\nStorageManagerService: Volume public:253,81 broadcasting checking to UserHandle{0}\nStorageManagerService: Volume public:253,81 broadcasting mounted to UserHandle{0}.\n\nThe reason why it works is that, all the calls on handler go in serial fashion. Please let me know if you have any other thoughts.",
      "parentUuid": "b5d49f3b_43d49824",
